	(text "ESP32 2.8in touch display module (Cheap Yellow Display, ESP32-2432S028R type) - off-board, 3 pigtails:\n  UART: RXD / TXD / GND / 5V       -> J7: 5V -> pad 3, GND -> pad 4 (reversed!). USB 5V, powers the relay coils.\n  3V3 : 3.3V / IO35 / nc / GND     -> J8: GND -> pad 1, 3.3V -> pad 4. Module LDO feeds U1, U2, pull-ups.\n  SPI : IO23 / IO19 / IO18 / IO27  -> J8: IO18 (SCL) -> pad 2, IO27 (SDA) -> pad 3. IO18 shared w/ SD slot.\nRev A pad silk (P1 3/4, CN1 1-4) follows an assumed pinout: land wires by signal name, not by number.\nI2C addresses: MCP23017 0x20 (A2:A0 = 000), TMP275 0x48 (A2:A0 = GND). 4.7k pull-ups to 3V3 on this board.\nMCP23017 GPB0..GPB7 -> K4 S/R, K1 S/R, K2 S/R, K3 S/R; GPA0 -> K5 RESET, GPA1 -> K5 SET (layout order).\nMCP23017 GPA2..GPA7 are spare; the ESP32 side has no board connection beyond J7 and J8." (at 172.72 143.51 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a52faad4-0013-5d9d-89a9-27deb2ef2b5e"))
	(text "ESP32 display module harness" (at 25.4 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "14f9f5a4-36ba-567a-a856-b2bfcc2001f2"))
	(text "MCP23017 -> relay coil drivers" (at 66.04 80.01 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f917c5db-c818-5f34-a507-b659cc718b59"))
	(text "Temperature sensor (near 1 ohm)" (at 86.36 152.4 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f317a148-9cad-563b-bf53-80d54c687297"))
